# Quad in X. On 4.x this is all it takes: setting FRAME_CLASS builds the
# mixer, which in turn assigns SERVO1..4_FUNCTION to Motor1..4. Do not set
# SERVOn_FUNCTION by hand on a multirotor -- the mixer owns those.
#
# FRAME_CLASS 1 = quad, FRAME_TYPE 1 = X.
#
# X vs plus is about how the arms sit relative to the ARROW ON THE BOARD, not
# how the airframe looks in a photo. Get it wrong and the aircraft flips on
# takeoff, every time.
FRAME_CLASS,1
FRAME_TYPE,1
